WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.580
You can choose a different partner after the personality result.

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:09.680
Bulbasaur opens with Vine Whip. Read the move before confirming.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:15.800
Squirtle opens with Water Gun. Its evolution needs Power.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:21.810
Charmander opens with Ember. Plan Power and move level five.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:25.460
Confirm your choice, then use the build guide for its exact route.
